    [6477]={name="Grassland Sash",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Consumed by Hatred'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mankrik in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 60 Bristleback Quilboar Tusks to Mankrik at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Consumed by Hatred",lore="Perhaps you know the pain of uncertainty, perhaps not. But know this: I stand here every day, from the sun's rising till its decline, scouring the horizon for more of those monsters."},
    [6482]={name="Firewalker Boots",quality=2,ilvl=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Elixir of Pain'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Lydon in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Bring 10 vials of Mountain Lion Blood to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Elixir of Pain",lore="Oh...the flowers are blooming in Hillsbrad and the air is so fresh and brisk. I can't help but to wallow in the misery of it all. I look out my grimy window and long for the day when our New Plague brings this world the death it deserves."},
    [6503]={name="Harlequin Robes",quality=2,ilvl=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Egg Hunt'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Korran in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 12 Silithid Eggs and the Digging Claw to Korran at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Egg Hunt",lore="Hey. I been sent to the Crossroads to watch over the land and take note of its happenings for my masters in Orgrimmar. One object of my studies are the insect-like creatures found to the south in the Field of Giants."},
