    [9518]={name="Mud's Crushers",quality=2,ilvl=36,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hungry!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mudcrush Durtfeet in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Mudcrush Durtfeet in northern Dustwallow wants 12 Mirefin Heads.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Hungry!",lore="Mud big ogre. Me hungry. Go bash fishy. Bring Mud food. You feed Mud or Mud eat you."},
    [9520]={name="Silent Hunter",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Call to Arms'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Drum Fel in Arathi Highlands. Objective: Kill 10 Boulderfist Brutes and 4 Boulderfist Magi, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="Call to Arms",lore="The head of the beast is ready to be taken off... with great force. You have shown every sign that you are able to help us with this final mighty blow."},
    [9527]={name="Spellshifter Rod",quality=3,ilvl=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tiara of the Deep'. Starts with Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring the Tiara of the Deep to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Tiara of the Deep",lore="Long ago I possessed a beautiful piece of jewelry, the Tiara of the Deep. And not only was it pretty--it held great power for those with the knowledge to use it."},
    [9534]={name="Engineer's Guild Headpiece",quality=3,ilvl=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Divino-matic Rod'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris. Objective: Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Divino-matic Rod",lore="Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??"},
    [9536]={name="Fairywing Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Fine Mess'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kernobee in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit and then report to Scooty in Booty Bay.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="A Fine Mess",lore="Wha.. What happened? The last thing I remember is being captured by a group of dark iron dwarves, beaten to within an inch of my life and then thrown in here with these filthy troggs."},
    [9601]={name="Cushioned Boots",quality=1,ilvl=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sathrah's Sacrifice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Priestess A'moora in Darnassus. Objective: Priestess A'moora wants you to place Lady Sathrah's silvery spinnerets at the fountain inside the temple, and then return to her.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Sathrah's Sacrifice",lore="Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest."},
    [9603]={name="Gritroot Staff",quality=2,ilvl=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Relics of Wakening'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Athridas Bearmantle in Teldrassil. Objective: Retrieve the Relics of Wakening and bring them to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Relics of Wakening",lore="Gnarlpine invaders were seen ravaging the Ban'ethil Barrow Den to the west. The slumbering druids will be trapped in the Emerald Dream for eternity, unaware of their fate, unless we help."},
    [9604]={name="Mechanic's Pipehammer",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Data Rescue'. Starts with Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge. Objective: Bring a Prismatic Punch Card to Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Data Rescue",lore="When we fled Gnomeregan, we left so much data behind! Vitally important data! I need the data on a prismatic punch card, from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D high security terminal, deep in Gnomeregan."},
    [9605]={name="Repairman's Cape",quality=3,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Data Rescue'. Starts with Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge. Objective: Bring a Prismatic Punch Card to Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Data Rescue",lore="When we fled Gnomeregan, we left so much data behind! Vitally important data! I need the data on a prismatic punch card, from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D high security terminal, deep in Gnomeregan."},
    [9622]={name="Reedknot Ring",quality=2,ilvl=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jarl Needs a Blade'. Starts with \\\"Swamp Eye\\\" Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring a Moonsteel Broadsword to Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Jarl Needs a Blade",lore="I have cutting to do. I can't tell you what I'm going to cut, but... I need myself a blade. A certain blade... Some people call it a sword. I call it a swing blade."},
    [9623]={name="Civinad Robes",quality=3,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rig Wars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nogg in Orgrimmar. Objective: Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Rig Wars",lore="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."},
    [9630]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"},
    [9631]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"},
    [9632]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"},
    [9633]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"},
    [9634]={name="Skilled Handling Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Apothecary Zinge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Sealed Field Testing Kit to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Return to Apothecary Zinge",lore="\"Here you go, the power source is safely removed and the data is preserved. Well, safe journeys and all that."},
    [9635]={name="Master Apothecary Cape",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Apothecary Zinge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Sealed Field Testing Kit to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Return to Apothecary Zinge",lore="You secure the sealed testing kit for the journey back to the Undercity. Apothecary Zinge waits for you and the sealed field testing kit there."},
    [9642]={name="Band of the Great Tortoise",quality=2,ilvl=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tooga's Quest'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Tanaris. Objective: Show Tooga the way back to his wife, Torta.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Tooga's Quest",lore="I am so lost! My wife, Torta, sent me out to fetch dinner and I must have taken a wrong turn somewhere. Would you be so kind as to lead me back to Torta?"},
    [9644]={name="Thermotastic Egg Timer",quality=2,ilvl=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-17/TN!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Rescue OOX-17/TN!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-17/TN to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9647]={name="Failed Flying Experiment",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-22/FE!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rescue OOX-22/FE!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9648]={name="Chainlink Towel",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-22/FE!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rescue OOX-22/FE!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9649]={name="Royal Highmark Vestments",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Venom to the Undercity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Lydon. Objective: Bring Faranell's Parcel to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Venom to the Undercity",lore="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."},
    [9652]={name="Gryphon Rider's Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Sharpbeak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gryphon Master Talonaxe in The Hinterlands. Objective: Fight to the top of Jintha'Alor, kill Vile Priestess Hexx for the key to Sharpbeak's cage, and save Sharpbeak.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Saving Sharpbeak",lore="We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!"},
    [9655]={name="Seedtime Hoop",quality=2,ilvl=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Morrow Stone'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Feralas. Objective: Return the Sparkling Stone and the Stave of Equinex to Troyas Moonbreeze in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Morrow Stone",lore="The moment the artifact is removed from the Monolith, you feel the energy in the Stave of Equinex begin to fade."},
    [9657]={name="Vinehedge Cinch",quality=2,ilvl=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wandering Shay'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shay Leafrunner in Feralas. Objective: Pick up Shay's Bell from the chest.Escort Shay Leafrunner to Rockbiter's camp.",zone="Feralas",questName="Wandering Shay",lore="Do you think you could help me find my way back to my friend, Rockbiter? He was supposed to be watching me... But I do have a tendency to wander off now and then."},
    [9658]={name="Boots of the Maharishi",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gordunni Cobalt'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Orwin Gizzmick in Feralas. Objective: Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt.",zone="Feralas",questName="Gordunni Cobalt",lore="I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"},
    [9660]={name="Stargazer Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gordunni Cobalt'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Orwin Gizzmick in Feralas. Objective: Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt.",zone="Feralas",questName="Gordunni Cobalt",lore="I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"},
    [9665]={name="Wingcrest Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dark Heart'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Talo Thornhoof in Feralas. Objective: Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart.",zone="Feralas",questName="Dark Heart",lore="Edana Hatetalon is the queen of the Northspring harpies that reside in the ruins to the west. She is pure evil; I have heard that her heart is one of crystal."},
    [9678]={name="Tok'kar's Murloc Basher",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Threat From the Sea'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Katar in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Threat From the Sea",lore="Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you."},
    [9680]={name="Tok'kar's Murloc Shanker",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Threat From the Sea'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Katar in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Threat From the Sea",lore="Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you."},
    [9682]={name="Leather Chef's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=44,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fresh Meat'. Starts with Dar in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Bring 10 Monstrous Crawler Legs to Dar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Fresh Meat",lore="There's a high demand for the succulent taste of crawler meat among my customers; especially the meat from the monstrous crawlers."},
    [9683]={name="Strength of the Treant",quality=2,ilvl=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas. Objective: Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
    [9686]={name="Spirit of the Faerie Dragon",quality=2,ilvl=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas. Objective: Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
    [9687]={name="Grappler's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [9698]={name="Gloves of Insight",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [9699]={name="Garrison Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [9703]={name="Scorched Cape",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Identifying the Brood'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Identifying the Brood",lore="Whilst that craven fool, Mok'Morokk, wallows in power and Tharg wrestles the demons of sorrow and vengeance and vies for leadership of the clan, I seem to be the only one concerned with identifying the source of aggression on our old home."},
    [9705]={name="Tharg's Shoelace",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Army of the Black Dragon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tharg in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Tharg in Brackenwall Village wants you to kill 15 Firemane Scouts, 10 Firemane Ash Tails, and 5 Firemane Guards.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Army of the Black Dragon",lore="Black dragons kill many ogre. Kill Tharg's wife."},
