    [16608]={name="Aquarius Belt",quality=2,ilvl=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Aquatic Form'. Starts with Dendrite Starblaze in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Return to Thunder Bluff and show Turak Runetotem the Pendant of the Sea Lion.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Aquatic Form",lore="You have completed the necessary lessons all young druids are taught before they can adopt an aquatic aspect. Go now back to your trainer, Mathrengyl Bearwalker, in Darnassus."},
    [16623]={name="Opaline Medallion",quality=2,ilvl=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wildkin of Elune'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Erelas Ambersky in Darnassus. Objective: Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Wildkin of Elune",lore="That's fascinating! I have always wondered about the truth... Well, you must share this knowledge, definitely! Go to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm right away -- you'll find him in Darnassus, in the Cenarion Circle."},
    [16658]={name="Wildhunter Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Completed'. Starts with Senani Thunderheart in Ashenvale. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, you have slain all three beasts that comprise the Ashenvale Hunt. &nbsp;You have brought me adequate proof of their demise; there is no question of your strength and tenacity. &nbsp;The blood of a hunter streaks through your veins, and you should be commended!Please, accept this bauble as a sign of congratulations on your mighty deeds done in Ashenvale for the Horde today. &nbsp;May your ancestors watch over you!",zone="Ashenvale",questName="The Hunt Completed"},
    [16659]={name="Deftkin Belt",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Je'neu of the Earthen Ring'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mastok Wrilehiss in Ashenvale. Objective: Bring the Befouled Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Je'neu of the Earthen Ring",lore="The Earthen Ring is a shamanistic group dedicated to studying and preserving the elements. They have forgotten more about crazy old gods, ancient legends and lore than most scholars will ever know."},
    [16661]={name="Soft Willow Cape",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Je'neu of the Earthen Ring'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mastok Wrilehiss in Ashenvale. Objective: Bring the Befouled Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Je'neu of the Earthen Ring",lore="The Earthen Ring is a shamanistic group dedicated to studying and preserving the elements. They have forgotten more about crazy old gods, ancient legends and lore than most scholars will ever know."},
    [16706]={name="Wildheart Vest",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Drakkisath.",zone="Blackrock Spire",npc="General Drakkisath"},
    [16714]={name="Wildheart Bracers",quality=3,ilvl=57,reqLevel=52,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Crimson Inquisitor.",zone="Stratholme",npc="Crimson Inquisitor"},
    [16715]={name="Wildheart Boots",quality=3,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mother Smolderweb.",zone="Blackrock Spire",npc="Mother Smolderweb"},
    [16716]={name="Wildheart Belt",quality=3,ilvl=58,reqLevel=53,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from The Ravenian.",zone="Scholomance",npc="The Ravenian"},
    [16719]={name="Wildheart Kilt",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=56,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Baron Rivendare.",zone="Stratholme",npc="Baron Rivendare"},
    [16738]={name="Witherseed Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Dunemaul Compound'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Andi Lynn in Tanaris. Objective: Andi Lynn in Gadgetzan wants you to destroy the Dunemaul Compound by killing 10 Dunemaul Brutes, 10 Dunemaul Enforcers, and Gor'marok the Ravager.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Dunemaul Compound",lore="Just recently, a large band of nomadic ogres arrived in Tanaris. South of here, they have taken over a large area of the desert and formed a compound."},
    [16739]={name="Rugwood Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Dunemaul Compound'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Andi Lynn in Tanaris. Objective: Andi Lynn in Gadgetzan wants you to destroy the Dunemaul Compound by killing 10 Dunemaul Brutes, 10 Dunemaul Enforcers, and Gor'marok the Ravager.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Dunemaul Compound",lore="Just recently, a large band of nomadic ogres arrived in Tanaris. South of here, they have taken over a large area of the desert and formed a compound."},
    [16740]={name="Shredder Operating Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Lost Pages'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gurda Ragescar in Ashenvale. Objective: Find the 12 missing pages of the Shredder Operating Manual, and put them together to form Chapters 1, 2, and 3. Return the pages to Gurda Ragescar near Splintertree Post.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="The Lost Pages",lore="I just picked up this shredder from Ratchet and I was on my way back to the Warsong Lumber Camp, where I am supposed to be on duty."},
    [16741]={name="Oilrag Handwraps",quality=2,ilvl=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Lost Pages'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gurda Ragescar in Ashenvale. Objective: Find the 12 missing pages of the Shredder Operating Manual, and put them together to form Chapters 1, 2, and 3. Return the pages to Gurda Ragescar near Splintertree Post.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="The Lost Pages",lore="I just picked up this shredder from Ratchet and I was on my way back to the Warsong Lumber Camp, where I am supposed to be on duty."},
    [16768]={name="Furbolg Medicine Pouch",quality=2,ilvl=52,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Gorn One Eye.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",npc="Gorn One Eye",proc="Use: Restores 100 health every 1 sec for 10 sec. (20 Min Cooldown)"},
    [16769]={name="Furbolg Medicine Totem",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Gorn One Eye.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",npc="Gorn One Eye"},
    [16791]={name="Silkstream Cuffs",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Book of the Ancients'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Azore Aldamort in Desolace. Objective: Get the Book of the Ancients and return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor.",zone="Desolace",questName="Book of the Ancients",lore="I entrust you with the Gem of the Serpent. Place this gem on the Serpent Statue's hand on Ranazjar Isle, a small island northwest of here. Placing it will summon the one who protects the Book of the Ancients."},
    [16828]={name="Cenarion Belt",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 60-63."},
    [16829]={name="Cenarion Boots",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lucifron.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Lucifron",lore="The first of Ragnaros's lieutenants a raid meets, and the one that turns your own spells against you."},
    [16830]={name="Cenarion Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 60-63."},
    [16831]={name="Cenarion Gloves",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Shazzrah.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Shazzrah",lore="A flame imp given rank, and the reason the Core's casters cannot be left standing together."},
    [16833]={name="Cenarion Vestments",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Golemagg the Incinerator.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Golemagg the Incinerator",lore="A core rager grown past all the others, flanked by two hounds that cannot be killed while he stands."},
    [16834]={name="Cenarion Helm",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Garr.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Garr",lore="A lieutenant of Ragnaros who fights surrounded by his Firesworn, and grows stronger each time one of them falls."},
    [16835]={name="Cenarion Leggings",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Magmadar.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Magmadar",lore="A core hound of the deep fire, kept as a guard beast and fed by Ragnaros's lieutenants."},
    [16836]={name="Cenarion Spaulders",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Baron Geddon.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Baron Geddon",lore="One of Ragnaros's most destructive lieutenants -- he ends the fight by turning himself into the bomb."},
    [16873]={name="Braidfur Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Portals of the Legion'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Taiga Wisemane in Desolace. Objective: Banish 6 Portals at Mannoroc Coven and return to Taiga Wisemane at Shadowprey Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Portals of the Legion",lore="Behold - the Hand of Iruxos. A gruesome sight indeed. You must possess it if the demon portals at Mannoroc Coven are to be banished... which is what I now ask you to do."},
    [16889]={name="Polished Walking Staff",quality=2,ilvl=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Torek's Assault'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Ashenvale. Objective: Escort Torek on his attack against Silverwing Outpost and Duriel Moonfire, then report to Ertog Ragetusk at Splintertree Post.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Torek's Assault",lore="Hey!! Come here! My raiders and I are about to attack the Silverwing Outpost to the west. Our target is its leader, Duriel Moonfire. Scouts report the outpost is defended heavily with sentinels and warriors."},
    [16894]={name="Clear Crystal Rod",quality=2,ilvl=21,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arachnophobia'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Kill Besseleth and bring Besseleth's Fang to Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Arachnophobia",lore="Warning: Proceed into Sishir Canyon west of here at your own risk. Besseleth and her eight-legged children of the forest have claimed this canyon as their webbed lair."},
    [16975]={name="Warsong Sash",quality=3,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Warsong Supplies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Locke Okarr in Ashenvale. Objective: Collect the Warsong Supplies: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil, and the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr in Splintertree Post.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Warsong Supplies",lore="We are in short supply of a few items at the Warsong lumber camp!"},
    [16977]={name="Warsong Boots",quality=3,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Warsong Supplies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Locke Okarr in Ashenvale. Objective: Collect the Warsong Supplies: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil, and the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr in Splintertree Post.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Warsong Supplies",lore="We are in short supply of a few items at the Warsong lumber camp!"},
    [16981]={name="Owlbeard Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Earthen Arise'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mor'rogal in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Open the Resonite cask with the Enchanted Resonite Crystal, and then slay Goggeroc. Return to Mor'rogal with the news and Enchanted Resonite Crystal.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Earthen Arise",lore="You have uncovered a dark threat to the land. The Resonite cask you have found in that cave houses a slumbering Earthen by the name of Goggeroc."},
    [16982]={name="Corehound Boots",quality=4,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [16983]={name="Molten Helm",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [16987]={name="Screecher Belt",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bloodfury Bloodline'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maggran Earthbinder in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Bloodfury Bloodline",lore="Limiting the number of Bloodfury Harpies will not be enough. The only true cure for their disease would be to slay their leader, Bloodfury Ripper!"},
    [16990]={name="Spritekin Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bloodfury Bloodline'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maggran Earthbinder in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Bloodfury Bloodline",lore="Limiting the number of Bloodfury Harpies will not be enough. The only true cure for their disease would be to slay their leader, Bloodfury Ripper!"},
    [16994]={name="Duskwing Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller.It is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...",lore="Yes, imbecile, perhaps you are ready for a more involved set of missions. The albino demon bat, Duskwing, roams the countryside just north of here."},
    [16995]={name="Duskwing Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller.It is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...",lore="Yes, imbecile, perhaps you are ready for a more involved set of missions. The albino demon bat, Duskwing, roams the countryside just north of here."},
    [17004]={name="Sarah's Guide",quality=2,ilvl=61,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corpulent One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Find Borelgore in the northern wastes of Eastern Plaguelands and destroy him. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when the mission is complete.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="The Corpulent One",lore="Past the Argent Dawn encampment of Light's Hope and west of Northdale, you will find the corpulent maggot beast, Borelgore. I've lost entire regiments to that monster."},
    [17005]={name="Boorguard Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'King of the Foulweald'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Karang Amakkar in Ashenvale. Objective: Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound. Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner. Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="King of the Foulweald",lore="another tribe of Furbolgs, the Foulweald, live southeast of Astranaar. They are not as many as the Thistlefur, but their ferocity poses a future threat."},
    [17043]={name="Zealot's Robe",quality=2,ilvl=36,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'An Unholy Alliance'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras in the Undercity.",zone="Razorfen Downs",questName="An Unholy Alliance",lore="Malcin claims he is outside Razorfen Downs. This ambassador must be slain--his mission a failure in the eyes of the Lich King."},
    [17047]={name="Luminescent Amice",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fallen Sky Lake'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Pelturas Whitemoon in Ashenvale. Objective: Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [17082]={name="Shard of the Flame",quality=4,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ragnaros.",npc="Ragnaros",lore="The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."},
    [17111]={name="Blazefury Medallion",quality=4,ilvl=68,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Kazzak.",zone="The Tainted Scar",npc="Lord Kazzak",lore="A pit lord left behind when the Legion's invasion collapsed, still holding the Tainted Scar where the Dark Portal's blast burned the land."},
    [17182]={name="Sulfuras, Hand of Ragnaros",quality=5,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="special",instructions="Sulfuras, Hand of Ragnaros - Eye of Sulfuras (Ragnaros) + Sulfuron Hammer.",lore="Ragnaros wielded this hammer as the Firelord. Reforging it means taking the Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros himself and setting it into the Sulfuron Hammer.",proc="Chance on hit: Hurls a fiery ball that causes 273 to 333 Fire damage and an additional 75 damage over 10 sec."},
    [17523]={name="Smokey's Drape",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent'. Starts with Smokey LaRue in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Travel to Plaguewood, northwest of Light's Hope. Destroy 8 Scourge Structures by using Smokey's Special Compound at the Mark of Detonation planted inside each building. Smokey has had the Ziggurats and Slaughterhouses marked.Once you plant the bomb, leave the building and marvel at your handiwork.By the way, Smokey's Special Compound is rather... unstable.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent",lore="While you were gathering the supplies, I had some of my people handle marking the Scourge buildings we need demolished. Here's the plan: I'm going to give you ten sticks of my special compound."},
    [17692]={name="Horn Ring",quality=2,ilvl=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Vorsha the Lasher'. Starts with Muglash in Ashenvale. Objective: Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga.If you are successful, return to the Zoram'gar Outpost and inform the Warsong Runner of the death of Vorsha the Lasher.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Vorsha the Lasher",lore="Vorsha the Lasher... the fiendish hydra that roams the seas... She has attacked our outpost, each time unprovoked, laying waste to anything that falls in her path."},
    [17715]={name="Eye of Theradras",quality=3,ilvl=54,reqLevel=48,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Princess Theradras.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Princess Theradras",lore="A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."},
    [17721]={name="Gloves of the Greatfather",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=33,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [17732]={name="Rotgrip Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Rotgrip.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Rotgrip"},
    [17741]={name="Nature's Embrace",quality=3,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Meshlok the Harvester.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Meshlok the Harvester"},
    [17743]={name="Resurgence Rod",quality=3,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Corruption of Earth and Seed'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Selendra in Maraudon. Objective: Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Corruption of Earth and Seed",lore="Deep in Maraudon lives an evil creature of chaos--Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she and Zaetar, first son of Cenarius, began a relationship."},
    [17775]={name="Acumen Robes",quality=2,ilvl=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twisted Evils'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Willow in Desolace. Objective: Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Twisted Evils",lore="The crystal caverns of Terramok lie to the west, deep within Maraudon... It is an ancient place with much history. And I am looking to get my hands on some of it."},
    [17901]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 3",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Honored Amongst the Guard'. Starts with Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressThe base buzzes with news of your exploits in the Field of Strife! You have struck mighty blows against our enemy - crushing their morale! For this, you have earned a rank of honor among the Stormpike.Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Honored Amongst the Guard",lore="You have struck mighty blows against our enemy - crushing their morale! For this, you have earned a rank of honor among the Stormpike.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17902]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 4",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Earned Reverence'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressSo many slain. Blood drenches the fields. Yet... You live... You have persevered. You have led our armies to many victories. For this, then, soldier, you have earned a new rank.Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Earned Reverence",lore="You have earned reverence among the Guard. Present your insignia!",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17903]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 5",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Legendary Heroes'. Starts with Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressBefore me stands an exalted hero of the Alliance.&lt;Lieutenant Haggerdin salutes.&gt;Few have earned such a rank among the Stormpike. I have watched the enemy fall before you. I have seen their resolve crumble in your presence. When you enter the fray, you become the beacon of hope for our forces!Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Legendary Heroes",lore="Rise and be honored! Present your insignia.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17904]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 6",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Eye of Command'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressDrek'Thar sings your praises. Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics. The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.You have earned the Eye of Command.Present your insignia, Commander &lt;name&gt;.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Eye of Command",lore="Your time has come again. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar."},
    [17906]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 3",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Honored Amongst the Clan'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressIt is good to see you again, &lt;class&gt;. I had not expected you to return. Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf.Your time has come again, &lt;name&gt;. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature.Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Honored Amongst the Clan",lore="I had not expected you to return. Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17907]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 4",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Earned Reverence'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressSo many slain. Blood drenches the fields. Yet... You live... You have persevered. You have led our armies to many victories. For this, then, soldier, you have earned a new rank.Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Earned Reverence",lore="You have earned reverence among the Guard. Present your insignia!",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17908]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 5",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Legendary Heroes'. Starts with Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressBefore me stands an exalted hero of the Alliance.&lt;Lieutenant Haggerdin salutes.&gt;Few have earned such a rank among the Stormpike. I have watched the enemy fall before you. I have seen their resolve crumble in your presence. When you enter the fray, you become the beacon of hope for our forces!Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Legendary Heroes",lore="Your radiate command and power, shaman. Exalted in the eyes of Frostwolf - the enemy cowers at the mention of your name.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17909]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 6",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Eye of Command'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressDrek'Thar sings your praises. Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics. The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.You have earned the Eye of Command.Present your insignia, Commander &lt;name&gt;.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Eye of Command",lore="You have earned the Eye of Command. Present your insignia, Commander.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep."},
