    [18398]={name="Tidal Loop",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Hero's Reward'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Duke Hydraxis in Azshara. Objective: Claim your reward from Hydraxis' Coffer.",zone="Azshara",questName="A Hero's Reward",lore="your services to the Warlords surpassed all we could expect from the denizens of this world. We do not understand your people's notions of gratitude, or rewarding good works, but in this case..."},
