    [19610]={name="Enchanted South Seas Kelp",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Enchanted South Seas Kelp'. Starts with Maywiki of Zuldazar in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: ProgressHow be that talisman, mon? It look like it be time to add a little more magic and mojo to its leaves. It need a little bloom in its wilt. Give it here and Maywiki fix it right up.",zone="Zul'Gurub",questName="Enchanted South Seas Kelp"},
