    [20704]={name="Cenarion Reservist's Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Armaments of War'. Starts with Geologist Larksbane in Silithus. Objective: War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded.Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass...The future of us all could be at an end.These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert.",zone="Silithus",questName="Armaments of War"},
    [20714]={name="Sandstorm Boots",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Armaments of War'. Starts with Geologist Larksbane in Silithus. Objective: War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded.Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass...The future of us all could be at an end.These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert.",zone="Silithus",questName="Armaments of War"},
    [20724]={name="Corrupted Blackwood Staff",quality=2,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Into The Maw of Madness'. Starts with Commander Mar'alith in Silithus. Objective: Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.Do not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.And &lt;name&gt;, remember the Commander's words: \"Do what you must...\".",zone="Silithus",questName="Into The Maw of Madness",lore="I need you to venture into Hive'Regal and find what became of my dearest Natalia. This will be no easy task for you. Before you dive headlong into the maw of madness, make sure that you go back and speak with those dwarves."},
