    [22495]={name="Dreamwalker Wristguards",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dreamwalker Wristguards'. Starts with Rayne in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Wristguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Dreamwalker Wristguards",lore="From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes."},
    [22632]={name="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",quality=5,ilvl=90,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian'. Objective: Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him.",questName="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",lore="The Guardian's staff, broken and scattered. Rebuilding it means gathering forty splinters from Naxxramas, the base from Kel'Thuzad, and carrying it to the ruin of Karazhan where Medivh once held it.",proc="Use: Creates a portal, teleporting group members that use it to Karazhan. (1 Min Cooldown)"},
    [22652]={name="Glacial Vest",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glacial Vest'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 8 Frozen Runes, 8 Bolts of Runecloth, 6 Essences of Water, 4 Ironweb Spider Silks and 300 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Glacial Vest",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Glacial vest."},
    [22654]={name="Glacial Gloves",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glacial Gloves'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 4 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Glacial Gloves",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial gloves."},
