    [22661]={name="Polar Tunic",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Polar Tunic'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 8 Frozen Runes, 16 Enchanted Leathers, 5 Essences of Water, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 300 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Polar Tunic",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Polar tunic."},
    [22662]={name="Polar Gloves",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Polar Gloves'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Polar Gloves",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar gloves."},
    [22663]={name="Polar Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Polar Bracers'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Polar Bracers",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar bracers."},
    [22667]={name="Bracers of Hope",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge."},
